+## 12. Locations
+
+The installed run-study text names one *studies directory* per studied package, written `<studies-dir>`. In fusion-tea it is `exploration/<pkg>/studies/`, where `<pkg>` is the package's directory under `exploration/` — for example `exploration/stellarator_e2e/studies/`. It holds the package's `ANNEX.md`, its `DISCOVERY_LOG.md`, and one `<study-id>/` directory per record: a record is at `exploration/<pkg>/studies/<study-id>/`, and its log at `exploration/<pkg>/studies/DISCOVERY_LOG.md`.
